{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Send for yourself</b> juxtaposed with Miriam because of the evil report they told. <b>Send for yourself men.</b> Final letters: חכ\"ם — that they be wise and righteous. <b>Send for yourself</b> alludes to the count of של\"ח years — that they would be sent forth and go into exile, and in the 3,000th and של\"ח years the Temple was destroyed. Similarly: \"Send away from before Me and let them go\" (Jeremiah 15)."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:01.681557963Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}